INSERT INTO `astrologer_pages` VALUES (1,'chat','CHAT WITH ASTROLOGERS','Chat with Astrologer','Chat with an astrologer to get instant solutions to all your astrology needs. Be it personal life issues or professional life challenges, Astrotalk has got you covered. Avail <strong>24*7</strong> online chat service from the comfort of your house, provided by over <strong>48,000+</strong> expert astrologers. What\'s more, all your information will be kept confidential. Try now!','Sarvika Tiwari',NULL,'Typing','Namaste! How can I help you today?','Why AstroHero?','How we verify astrologers','Our 4-Step Process','Instantly Connect With Top Astrologers','AstroHero brings the wisdom of Vedic astrology, Tarot reading, Numerology, and Vastu experts directly to your fingertips. Filter our curated list of professionals by expertise, language, or ratings to find the perfect match. Engage in a secure, 1-on-1 private chat to receive clear, actionable insights for your life\'s biggest questions.\n\nExperience our premium service risk-free with your first chat completely on us! There are no hidden subscription fees—you simply pay for the minutes you use. If you aren\'t fully satisfied, you can seamlessly switch to another expert, and our 24-hour refund policy protects your peace of mind.','POPULAR TOPICS','Explore AstroHero Services','Everything you need to know about chatting with astrologers online.','2026-10-03 06:14:38','2026-10-03 06:30:54'),(2,'talk','TALK TO ASTROLOGERS','Talk to Astrologers Online','Talk to astrologer online to get detailed and accurate guidance for every issue in life. This includes love, marriage, finances, health, and even education-related problems. The <strong>24*7</strong> online consultation service by AstroHero will help you relish your life by guiding you through every challenge and hurdle. With over <strong>48,000+</strong> verified astrologers that provide personalised solutions, you can ask any questions that come to your mind. Try now!','Sarvika Tiwari',NULL,'Calling','06:54','Why AstroHero?','How we verify astrologers','Our 4-Step Process','Instantly Connect With Top Astrologers','AstroHero brings the wisdom of Vedic astrology, Tarot reading, Numerology, and Vastu experts directly to your fingertips. Filter our curated list of professionals by expertise, language, or ratings to find the perfect match. Engage in a secure, 1-on-1 private call to receive clear, actionable insights for your life\'s biggest questions.\n\nExperience our premium service risk-free with your first call completely on us! There are no hidden subscription fees—you simply pay for the minutes you use. If you aren\'t fully satisfied, you can seamlessly switch to another expert, and our 24-hour refund policy protects your peace of mind.','POPULAR TOPICS','Explore AstroHero Services','Everything you need to know about calling astrologers online.','2026-10-03 06:14:38','2026-10-03 06:14:38');
