INSERT INTO `daily_horoscopes` VALUES (1,'Aries','Mesh','Mar 21 – Apr 19','Today','2026-10-01','The Moon in Taurus may leave you feeling a little emotionally confused today, so don\'t put too much pressure on yourself to have everything figured out immediately. Those in long-term relationships will feel a deep urge to connect authentically, while financial decisions require patient evaluation before committing funds. Avoid impulsive arguments with parents or elders this evening.','#FF4500','9','Today · 1 Oct 2026','✨ Calm','Mars','Ram ♈','The Sun','Ruby',80,'Good',NULL,85,'Strong',NULL,90,'High',NULL,50,'Slow',NULL,'2026-10-01 06:18:48','2026-10-01 06:18:48'),(2,'Aries','Mesh','Mar 21 – Apr 19','Tomorrow','2026-10-01','You share a strong bond with your family, so you may feel today that something at home is not quite right. Instead of letting these thoughts disturb you, focus on protecting your mental peace. If you are single, try to meet and interact with more people today. When it comes to your career, it is better to avoid taking any major risks for now. Our astrologers suggest donating something yellow to someone in need today.','#00FF00','4','Tomorrow · 2 Oct 2026','😇 Blessed','Mars','Ram ♈','The Sun','Ruby',92,'High',NULL,80,'Strong',NULL,80,'Good',NULL,68,'Steady',NULL,'2026-10-01 06:18:48','2026-10-01 06:18:48'),(3,'Aries','Mesh','Mar 21 – Apr 19','Week','2026-10-01','Personal: This week brings profound personal insight, favoring deep introspection about lingering patterns. A truth you have avoided surfaces by Thursday, offering genuine liberation.\n\nMoney: Financial matters intensify this week, with Tuesday favoring investigation into shared resources or hidden costs.\n\nHealth: Intense emotions may manifest physically this week, so Wednesday favors stress-relief through deep breathing or yoga.\n\nLove: Passion runs deep this week, with Wednesday favoring intense, meaningful conversations with a partner.\n\nRemedy: Wear deep red or black, and carry obsidian for protection and emotional grounding.','#FFD700','7','27 Sept – 03 Oct 2026','🎯 Focused','Mars','Ram ♈','The Sun','Ruby',75,'Steady',NULL,88,'High',NULL,82,'Strong',NULL,78,'Good',NULL,'2026-10-01 06:18:48','2026-10-01 06:18:48'),(4,'Aries','Mesh','Mar 21 – Apr 19','Month','2026-10-01','October could discreetly draw you out of the chaos and into introspection. An email from an old friend living overseas or a practice you forgot about could introduce a new perspective into your life.\n\nCareer: This month, you might find yourself broadening your thoughts about your career rather than looking only at your current position.\n\nFinance: There may be more than one financial development that occurs this month. You could find a new way to earn money or increase investments.\n\nLove and Relationships: There might be one intimate relationship that grows stronger towards the end of the month.\n\nRemedy: Read the Hanuman Chalisa regularly to disperse mental restlessness.','#E3B568','3','October 2026','✨ Radiant','Mars','Ram ♈','The Sun','Ruby',85,'Strong',NULL,94,'Mastery',NULL,80,'Balanced',NULL,88,'Thriving',NULL,'2026-10-01 06:18:48','2026-10-01 06:18:48'),(5,'Aries','Mesh','Mar 21 – Apr 19','Year','2026-10-01','Love and Relationships: 2026 brings emotional transformation and deeper honesty in your love life. Singles may feel drawn toward intense, meaningful connections rather than casual attractions.\n\nHealth and Wellness: Your physical strength remains good in 2026, but emotional stress may affect your overall well-being. Regular rest and hydration will help maintain balance.\n\nCareer and Education: Career growth this year comes through strategic planning and determination. You may be entrusted with confidential or high-responsibility roles.\n\nMoney and Finances: Financially, 2026 encourages cautious growth and long-term planning. Income remains steady, but avoid risky investments.\n\nTip of the Year: Embrace transformation, not control. In 2026, letting go of emotional baggage will open doors to massive growth.','#E3B568','1','2026','🏆 Triumphant','Mars','Ram ♈','The Sun','Ruby',90,'High',NULL,95,'Peak',NULL,85,'Steady',NULL,92,'Wealth Inflow',NULL,'2026-10-01 06:18:48','2026-10-01 06:18:48'),(6,'Taurus','Vrishabh','Apr 20 – May 20','Today','2026-10-01','With the Moon dwelling in your sign today, your personal magnetism and charm are reaching peak levels. Venus offers wonderful support for smooth negotiations at work and romantic harmony at home. However, watch out for stubborn tendencies when someone offers constructive feedback. Trust your intuitive instincts regarding a new monetary venture.','#2E8B57','6','Today · 1 Oct 2026','🤠 Proud','Venus','Bull ♉','The Sun','Ruby',88,'Strong',NULL,82,'Good',NULL,91,'High',NULL,75,'Steady',NULL,'2026-10-01 06:18:48','2026-10-01 06:18:48'),(7,'Taurus','Vrishabh','Apr 20 – May 20','Tomorrow','2026-10-01','Your financial planning will see positive results as Jupiter brings stability to your wealth sector. Friends or colleagues will appreciate your grounded advice during a crisis. Romance takes a sweet, comforting turn as evening approaches, making it an ideal time for a quiet dinner. Prioritize physical stretching to keep stiffness away.','#E3B568','2','Tomorrow · 2 Oct 2026','✨ Calm','Venus','Bull ♉','The Sun','Ruby',85,'Good',NULL,86,'Strong',NULL,84,'Good',NULL,80,'Good',NULL,'2026-10-01 06:18:48','2026-10-01 06:18:48'),(8,'Taurus','Vrishabh','Apr 20 – May 20','Week','2026-10-01','Personal: Comfort and self-care take center stage this week as you redefine your personal boundaries and desires.\n\nMoney: Excellent prospects for long-term investments arise mid-week, thanks to favorable planetary alignment in your financial house.\n\nHealth: Throat and neck areas need gentle care; avoid excessive cold foods and maintain regular hydration.\n\nLove: Venusian energy blesses your romantic life, inviting sweet gestures and deepening trust with your partner.\n\nRemedy: Light a jasmine oil lamp in your home temple every evening for abundance and peace.','#FF4500','5','27 Sept – 03 Oct 2026','🎯 Focused','Venus','Bull ♉','The Sun','Ruby',90,'Strong',NULL,82,'Steady',NULL,85,'Good',NULL,89,'High',NULL,'2026-10-01 06:18:48','2026-10-01 06:18:48'),(9,'Taurus','Vrishabh','Apr 20 – May 20','Month','2026-10-01','October rewards your patience with tangible rewards in professional and personal arenas. Your artistic or analytical talents will receive recognition from higher authorities.\n\nCareer: Steady progression is guaranteed as you master your daily tasks with immaculate precision.\n\nFinance: Savings grow significantly this month due to controlled expenditures and smart budgeting.\n\nLove and Relationships: Existing bonds strengthen, and single Taureans may encounter a kindred spirit through professional networks.\n\nRemedy: Feed fresh green grass to cows on Fridays to appease Venus.','#00FF00','6','October 2026','✨ Radiant','Venus','Bull ♉','The Sun','Ruby',91,'High',NULL,88,'Strong',NULL,89,'High',NULL,93,'Thriving',NULL,'2026-10-01 06:18:48','2026-10-01 06:18:48'),(10,'Taurus','Vrishabh','Apr 20 – May 20','Year','2026-10-01','Love and Relationships: 2026 is a milestone year for commitments, engagements, and deepening family ties.\n\nHealth and Wellness: Maintaining a balanced diet and regular physical activity will keep vitality at its peak all year round.\n\nCareer and Education: Promotions and leadership roles are heavily favored during the second half of the year.\n\nMoney and Finances: Wealth accumulation reaches new heights, opening doors for purchasing property or valuable assets.\n\nTip of the Year: Embrace change gracefully; clinging too tightly to the familiar may delay necessary breakthroughs.','#E3B568','8','2026','🏆 Triumphant','Venus','Bull ♉','The Sun','Ruby',95,'Wealth Inflow',NULL,92,'Peak',NULL,90,'High',NULL,96,'Thriving',NULL,'2026-10-01 06:18:48','2026-10-01 06:18:48'),(11,'Gemini','Mithun','May 21 – Jun 20','Today','2026-10-01','Mercury\'s swift current keeps your intellectual curiosity sharp, making today ideal for brainstorming, writing, or learning new skills. However, ensure you do not scatter your energy across too many tasks simultaneously. Social interactions bring unexpected joy, but be cautious with gossip at the workplace. Take short breaks to rest your eyes.','#FFD700','5','Today · 1 Oct 2026','⚡ Energetic','Mercury','Twins ♊','The Sun','Ruby',78,'Good',NULL,89,'High',NULL,76,'Steady',NULL,80,'Good',NULL,'2026-10-01 06:18:48','2026-10-01 06:18:48'),(12,'Gemini','Mithun','May 21 – Jun 20','Tomorrow','2026-10-01','A lively exchange of ideas with a colleague or partner opens up new collaborative horizons. Your adaptability is your greatest superpower right now, helping you navigate shifting schedules seamlessly. Keep communications transparent in romantic matters to avoid unnecessary misunderstandings. Drink plenty of water throughout the day.','#2E8B57','3','Tomorrow · 2 Oct 2026','🤠 Proud','Mercury','Twins ♊','The Sun','Ruby',84,'Strong',NULL,88,'Strong',NULL,82,'Good',NULL,77,'Steady',NULL,'2026-10-01 06:18:48','2026-10-01 06:18:48'),(13,'Gemini','Mithun','May 21 – Jun 20','Week','2026-10-01','Personal: Mental agility is unmatched this week, helping you solve complex personal puzzles with ease.\n\nMoney: Diversifying your income streams looks promising, but read the fine print before signing contracts.\n\nHealth: Nervous energy can cause restlessness; practice mindfulness or meditation to center your thoughts.\n\nLove: Intellectual compatibility takes precedence; engaging debates with your partner spark renewed affection.\n\nRemedy: Feed green moong dal to birds on Wednesday mornings to strengthen Mercury.','#E3B568','5','27 Sept – 03 Oct 2026','🎯 Focused','Mercury','Twins ♊','The Sun','Ruby',82,'Good',NULL,91,'High',NULL,79,'Steady',NULL,85,'Good',NULL,'2026-10-01 06:18:48','2026-10-01 06:18:48'),(14,'Gemini','Mithun','May 21 – Jun 20','Month','2026-10-01','October brings dynamic networking opportunities and exciting travel prospects. Your ability to connect with diverse groups of people paves the way for future success.\n\nCareer: Collaborative projects flourish, and your innovative presentations win praise from senior executives.\n\nFinance: Financial gains come through communication, media, or tech-related ventures.\n\nLove and Relationships: Honest dialogue clears the air, bringing you and your partner closer than ever.\n\nRemedy: Chant the Budha Beej Mantra daily for mental clarity.','#FF4500','5','October 2026','✨ Radiant','Mercury','Twins ♊','The Sun','Ruby',88,'Strong',NULL,92,'Thriving',NULL,83,'Good',NULL,84,'Steady',NULL,'2026-10-01 06:18:48','2026-10-01 06:18:48'),(15,'Gemini','Mithun','May 21 – Jun 20','Year','2026-10-01','Love and Relationships: 2026 encourages emotional depth over superficial charm in relationships, leading to lasting bonds.\n\nHealth and Wellness: Prioritize consistent sleep schedules to prevent mental fatigue from high activity levels.\n\nCareer and Education: Exceptional year for higher education, publishing, public speaking, and digital enterprises.\n\nMoney and Finances: Multiple income sources emerge, though impulsive spending requires careful monitoring.\n\nTip of the Year: Focus your formidable energy on one goal at a time to achieve extraordinary results.','#E3B568','3','2026','🏆 Triumphant','Mercury','Twins ♊','The Sun','Ruby',89,'High',NULL,94,'Peak',NULL,86,'Good',NULL,90,'Wealth Inflow',NULL,'2026-10-01 06:18:48','2026-10-01 06:18:48'),(16,'Cancer','Kark','Jun 21 – Jul 22','Today','2026-10-01','As your ruling planet, the Moon, highlights sensitive emotional sectors, you may feel deeply empathetic toward the struggles of those around you. Use this intuition to nurture your home environment and bond with family members. Avoid letting professional stress drain your emotional reservoir. A warm cup of herbal tea before bed will promote restful sleep.','#00FF00','2','Today · 1 Oct 2026','😇 Blessed','Moon','Crab ♋','The Sun','Ruby',92,'High',NULL,78,'Steady',NULL,85,'Good',NULL,79,'Good',NULL,'2026-10-01 06:18:48','2026-10-01 06:18:48'),(17,'Cancer','Kark','Jun 21 – Jul 22','Tomorrow','2026-10-01','Domestic harmony returns as you resolve a lingering household dispute with patience and care. Career matters demand emotional detachment so you can make objective, logical decisions. Financial prudence protects you from unnecessary expenses proposed by others. Spend quality time near water or in nature to recharge your spirit.','#E3B568','7','Tomorrow · 2 Oct 2026','✨ Calm','Moon','Crab ♋','The Sun','Ruby',89,'Strong',NULL,81,'Good',NULL,90,'High',NULL,75,'Steady',NULL,'2026-10-01 06:18:48','2026-10-01 06:18:48'),(18,'Cancer','Kark','Jun 21 – Jul 22','Week','2026-10-01','Personal: Emotional healing is strongly favored this week, allowing you to release past grievances and forgive yourself.\n\nMoney: Focus on securing family assets and reviewing long-term savings plans with trusted advisors.\n\nHealth: Water intake and emotional release through journaling will keep your physical and mental health robust.\n\nLove: Deep emotional intimacy creates an unbreakable sanctuary between you and your romantic partner.\n\nRemedy: Offer raw milk and water to a Shivling on Monday mornings for peace of mind.','#FFD700','2','27 Sept – 03 Oct 2026','🎯 Focused','Moon','Crab ♋','The Sun','Ruby',94,'High',NULL,80,'Steady',NULL,88,'High',NULL,82,'Good',NULL,'2026-10-01 06:18:48','2026-10-01 06:18:48'),(19,'Cancer','Kark','Jun 21 – Jul 22','Month','2026-10-01','October invites you to strengthen your foundation, focusing on home improvements and family milestones. Your intuitive guidance proves remarkably accurate in both personal and professional choices.\n\nCareer: Quiet, consistent effort brings steady recognition and appreciation from senior management.\n\nFinance: Property investments or home-related upgrades are favorable during this period.\n\nLove and Relationships: Unconditional support from loved ones fills your heart with gratitude and security.\n\nRemedy: Wear silver ornaments or keep a silver piece in your wallet to enhance lunar energy.','#2E8B57','2','October 2026','✨ Radiant','Moon','Crab ♋','The Sun','Ruby',95,'Thriving',NULL,85,'Strong',NULL,90,'Balanced',NULL,86,'Steady',NULL,'2026-10-01 06:18:48','2026-10-01 06:18:48'),(20,'Cancer','Kark','Jun 21 – Jul 22','Year','2026-10-01','Love and Relationships: 2026 brings profound relationship milestones, including marriage, cohabiting, or expanding the family.\n\nHealth and Wellness: Prioritize mental health and emotional boundaries to prevent absorbing stress from your environment.\n\nCareer and Education: Career shifts toward more fulfilling, purpose-driven paths bring deep satisfaction.\n\nMoney and Finances: Real estate investments and family wealth planning yield excellent returns.\n\nTip of the Year: Honor your sensitivity as a supreme strength rather than a vulnerability.','#E3B568','7','2026','🏆 Triumphant','Moon','Crab ♋','The Sun','Ruby',96,'High',NULL,88,'Steady',NULL,92,'High',NULL,94,'Wealth Inflow',NULL,'2026-10-01 06:18:48','2026-10-01 06:18:48'),(21,'Leo','Simha','Jul 23 – Aug 22','Today','2026-10-01','The radiant Sun infuses you with vibrant leadership energy today, making it a fantastic time to spearhead new projects and take charge in group settings. Your natural charisma wins admirers, but remember to practice humility when collaborating with teammates. Financial inflows look promising, but avoid extravagant impulse buying.','#FF4500','1','Today · 1 Oct 2026','🤠 Proud','Sun','Lion ♌','The Sun','Ruby',88,'Strong',NULL,95,'High',NULL,90,'High',NULL,85,'Good',NULL,'2026-10-01 06:18:48','2026-10-01 06:18:48'),(22,'Leo','Simha','Jul 23 – Aug 22','Tomorrow','2026-10-01','Recognition for past efforts comes your way, boosting your confidence to even greater heights. Romance sparkles as you plan a grand gesture to surprise your partner. Keep an eye on your posture and spinal health during