ivity this week.\n\nMoney: Meticulous financial planning opens opportunities to eliminate debts and optimize investments.\n\nHealth: Digestive wellness is vital; incorporate fiber-rich foods and herbal teas into your daily regimen.\n\nLove: Thoughtful conversations and practical support cement trust and affection with your partner.\n\nRemedy: Water Tulsi plants daily and offer green leaves for prosperity.','#E3B568','5','27 Sept – 03 Oct 2026','🎯 Focused','Mercury','Maiden ♍','The Sun','Ruby',82,'Good',NULL,93,'High',NULL,84,'Steady',NULL,90,'High',NULL,'2026-10-01 06:18:48','2026-10-01 06:18:48'),(29,'Virgo','Kanya','Aug 23 – Sep 22','Month','2026-10-01','October rewards your diligence with significant career breakthroughs and health improvements. Your problem-solving skills become indispensable to your team.\n\nCareer: Efficiency and precision lead to commendations and potential salary increments.\n\nFinance: Systematic savings plans and smart budgeting create a rock-solid financial cushion.\n\nLove and Relationships: Quiet, quality moments with your partner restore emotional equilibrium and warmth.\n\nRemedy: Donate books or educational stationery to underprivileged children.','#FFD700','5','October 2026','✨ Radiant','Mercury','Maiden ♍','The Sun','Ruby',86,'Strong',NULL,95,'Mastery',NULL,89,'High',NULL,91,'Thriving',NULL,'2026-10-01 06:18:48','2026-10-01 06:18:48'),(30,'Virgo','Kanya','Aug 23 – Sep 22','Year','2026-10-01','Love and Relationships: 2026 encourages emotional vulnerability, helping you build deeper, more authentic partnerships.\n\nHealth and Wellness: Adopting a structured wellness routine dramatically improves your stamina and overall well-being.\n\nCareer and Education: Precision, expertise, and dedication culminate in major career promotions and accolades.\n\nMoney and Finances: Exceptional fiscal discipline ensures robust wealth accumulation and secure investments.\n\nTip of the Year: Release the need for perfection; celebrate progress and allow yourself grace.','#E3B568','3','2026','🏆 Triumphant','Mercury','Maiden ♍','The Sun','Ruby',88,'High',NULL,96,'Peak',NULL,91,'High',NULL,95,'Wealth Inflow',NULL,'2026-10-01 06:18:48','2026-10-01 06:18:48'),(31,'Libra','Tula','Sep 23 – Oct 22','Today','2026-10-01','With Venus casting a harmonious glow in your sign, your charm, diplomacy, and aesthetic sense are irresistible today. Collaborative partnerships in both business and romance flourish effortlessly. Take time to weigh your options carefully before making any major purchases. A peaceful evening walk will help center your thoughts.','#E3B568','6','Today · 1 Oct 2026','😇 Blessed','Venus','Balance ♎','The Sun','Ruby',94,'High',NULL,88,'Strong',NULL,90,'High',NULL,84,'Good',NULL,'2026-10-01 06:18:48','2026-10-01 06:18:48'),(32,'Libra','Tula','Sep 23 – Oct 22','Tomorrow','2026-10-01','Social engagements and networking events bring delightful encounters and potential career alliances. Your ability to see both sides of every argument makes you an excellent mediator today. Romance takes a magical turn as deep mutual understanding blossoms. Maintain a balanced diet to keep energy levels stable.','#2E8B57','2','Tomorrow · 2 Oct 2026','✨ Calm','Venus','Balance ♎','The Sun','Ruby',91,'Strong',NULL,86,'Good',NULL,87,'Good',NULL,80,'Steady',NULL,'2026-10-01 06:18:48','2026-10-01 06:18:48'),(33,'Libra','Tula','Sep 23 – Oct 22','Week','2026-10-01','Personal: Relationships and partnerships take center stage, offering opportunities to restore balance and harmony.\n\nMoney: Joint finances and partnerships receive positive boosts; transparency ensures mutual growth.\n\nHealth: Lower back and kidney care require attention; stay well-hydrated and avoid overexertion.\n\nLove: Romance blooms brilliantly under Venusian rays, favoring engagements and heartfelt confessions.\n\nRemedy: Wear white or pastel clothes on Fridays and offer white sweets at a temple.','#FFD700','6','27 Sept – 03 Oct 2026','🎯 Focused','Venus','Balance ♎','The S