','Mithun','May 21 – Jun 20','Today','2026-10-07','As the Moon transits your 3rd house in Leo under the Magha Nakshatra on this Dwadashi of Krishna Paksha, your courage and communication skills are naturally highlighted. With your lord Mercury sitting in the 5th house in Libra alongside retrograde Venus, your intellectual pursuits and creative ideas flow smoothly despite some minor relationship hesitations. Meanwhile, Mars and Jupiter in the 2nd house in Cancer prompt you to watch your words carefully regarding family finances. Use this Wednesday to focus on short journeys and creative expression while keeping a check on impulsive speech.','#D4AF37','3','11:45 AM - 12:32 PM','💬 Focused','Mercury','Twins ♊','The Sun','Ruby',68,'Good',NULL,72,'Good',NULL,75,'Strong',NULL,65,'Good',NULL,'2026-10-07 00:44:58','2026-10-07 00:57:29'),(297,'Gemini','Mithun','May 21 – Jun 20','Tomorrow','2026-10-07','On Thursday, with the Moon advancing into Purva Phalguni Nakshatra while remaining in your 3rd house in Leo, your drive for personal initiatives and interactions remains robust. Trayodashi of Krishna Paksha encourages you to wrap up pending tasks that require physical effort or coordination with younger siblings and peers. Saturn continues its retrograde motion in your 10th house in Pisces, reminding you to stay grounded and patient with long-term career goals rather than rushing results. Channel your energy into productive conversations and steady progress without overexerting yourself.','#E5A93B','5','11:45 AM - 12:32 PM','⚡ Active','Mercury','Twins ♊','The Sun','Ruby',70,'Good',NULL,68,'Good',NULL,72,'Good',NULL,67,'Good',NULL,'2026-10-07 00:44:58','2026-10-07 00:57:29'),(298,'Gemini','Mithun','May 21 – Jun 20','Week','2026-10-07','Personal:\nYour week begins with the Moon in Cancer in your 2nd house on Monday and Tuesday, shifting your focus toward family matters and domestic comfort. By Wednesday and Thursday, the Moon moves into your 3rd house in Leo, boosting your daily interactions and courage.\n\nMoney:\nWith Mars and Jupiter placed in your 2nd house of wealth and family throughout the week, your financial thinking is active, but you must avoid impulsive spending. Keep a close eye on your savings as expenses related to home or family could arise unexpectedly.\n\nHealth:\nHealth remains generally stable, though the heavy influences in the 2nd and 3rd houses suggest keeping your throat and upper respiratory system protected. Ensure you get adequate rest on Friday through Sunday when the Moon enters your 4th house in Virgo.\n\nLove:\nMercury and retrograde Venus residing together in your 5th house bring a mix of romance and introspection to your love life. Existing relationships benefit from gentle communication, while single Gemini natives might reflect deeply on past connections.\n\nRemedy:\nChant the Budha mantra \'Om Bum Budhaya Namaha\' daily to strengthen your ruling planet and maintain mental clarity. Feed green fodder to a cow on Wednesday to help alleviate any planetary strains.','#008000','7','11:45 AM - 12:32 PM','⚖️ Balanced','Mercury','Twins ♊','The Sun','Ruby',65,'Good',NULL,70,'Good',NULL,74,'Good',NULL,62,'Steady',NULL,'2026-10-07 00:44:58','2026-10-07 00:57:29'),(299,'Gemini','Mithun','May 21 – Jun 20','Month','2026-10-07','October 2026 brings important shifts in your immediate environment and creative spheres as celestial bodies realign. Pay close attention to the Amavasya on October 10th and the Purnima on October 26th for emotional resets.\n\nCareer:\nSaturn remains retrograde in your 10th house in Pisces all month, demanding sustained patience and hard work in your professional life. Avoid taking shortcuts and focus on fulfilling your long-term duties steadily.\n\nFinance:\nMars and Jupiter are positioned in your 2nd house, urging caution and disciplined budgeting regarding your accumulated wealth and family resources. Guard against speculative investments during this period.\n\nLove and Relationships:\nYour 5th house hosts Mercury and retrograde Venus, making this a month for rethinking matters of the heart and creative projects. The Sun\'s movement from Virgo into Libra on October 18th will further illuminate your 5th house, bringing warmth and clarity to romantic matters.\n\nHealth:\nThe transit of the Sun through your 4th house until October 18th calls for attention to domestic harmony and your mother\'s well-being. Balance your professional workload with sufficient downtime to prevent mental fatigue.\n\nRemedy:\nOffer water to the Sun daily and recite the Vishnu Sahasranama on Thursdays to invite stability and prosperity into your life.','#FF8C00','1','11:45 AM - 12:32 PM','🌙 Reflective','Mercury','Twins ♊','The Sun','Ruby',69,'Good',NULL,64,'Steady',NULL,70,'Good',NULL,60,'Steady',NULL,'2026-10-07 00:44:58','2026-10-07 00:57:29'),(300,'Gemini','Mithun','May 21 – Jun 20','Year','2026-10-07','Love and Relationships:\nThe year 2026 begins with Jupiter in your 1st house, expanding your personal presence and attractiveness before it moves into your 2nd house in June, shifting focus toward family bonds. With Venus and Mercury heavily influencing your 5th house during the latter parts of the year, romantic relationships require thoughtful communication and patience.\n\nHealth and Wellness:\nSaturn anchors your 10th house in Pisces throughout the year, keeping your professional life demanding and testing your endurance. Take care of your mental well-being and maintain a disciplined daily routine to prevent stress-related fatigue.\n\nCareer and Education:\nYour career path is shaped by Saturn\'s steady presence in your 10th house, which rewards perseverance over hasty moves. Mars shifts signs frequently—moving from Capricorn in January, Pisces in April, Taurus in June, Gemini in August, Cancer in September, and finally Leo in November—bringing intermittent bursts of energy and workload changes.\n\nMoney and Finances:\nJupiter\'s transit into your 2nd house in June places a strong emphasis on wealth accumulation and financial restructuring. As Rahu sits in your 9th house and Ketu in your 3rd house for most of the year until their shift on December 6th, watch out for sudden changes in long-distance plans or financial partnerships.\n\nTip of the Year:\nEmbrace patience in your career and practice mindful financial management, especially during periods when Mars shifts into sensitive water signs.','#4B0082','9','11:45 AM - 12:32 PM','🌱 Steady','Mercury','Twins ♊','The Sun','Ruby',67,'Good',NULL,71,'Good',NULL,68,'Good',NULL,66,'Good',NULL,'2026-10-07 00:44:58','2026-10-07 00:57:29');
